{"version":1,"content":"<p>天文學家利用全球最強大的超級計算機之一，構建出迄今規模最大、精細程度最高的早期宇宙模擬之一。這項名為「Lumina」的研究項目，重現了宇宙誕生後最初20億年的演化過程，模擬區域每邊長達約15億光年，旨在幫助科學家理解第一批恆星和星系如何形成，以及暗物質和輻射如何共同塑造今天的宇宙。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/science/1585656.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-10T12:20:23.364260+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":146,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-09T17:26:50+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-10T12:33:58.536548+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-10T12:13:47.084728+00:00","content_hash":"a7b5ed5fb8b5dcb210b9c6bcb480191352ec63ce9e656437198b0e976a1e7285","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}